     }\n            if (i - lf + ls.size() >= cur.size()) {\n                ls = new ArrayList<>(cur);\n                lf = i;\n                ld = (int)((t - x.get(i)) % MOD);\n            }\n            cur = c;\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < cur.size(); ++i) {\n            cur.set(i, (int)((cur.get(i) % MOD + MOD) % MOD));\n        }\n        return cur;\n    }\n\n    static long work(List<Integer> x, long n) {\n        if (n < x.size()) return x.get((int)n);\n        List<Integer> v = BM(x);\n        int m = v.size();\n        if (m == 0) return 0;\n        long[] h = new long[m];\n        long[] a = new long[m];\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) {\n            h[i] = v.get(i);\n            a[i] = x.get(i);\n        }\n        return calc(n, m, h, a);\n    }\n\n    static long calc(long K, int m, long[] h, long[] a) {\n        long[] s = new long[m];\n        long[] t = new long[m];\n        s[0] = 1;\n        if (m != 1) t[1] = 1;\n        else t[0] = h[0];\n        long[] tt = new long[2 * m];\n        while (K > 0) {\n            if ((K & 1) == 1) mull(s, t, m, h, tt);\n            mull(t, t, m, h, tt);\n            K >>= 1;\n        }\n        long su = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) su = (su + s[i] * a[i]) % MOD;\n        return (su % MOD + MOD) % MOD;\n    }\n\n    static void mull(long[] p, long[] q, int m, long[] h, long[] tt) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < 2 * m; ++i) tt[i] = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) if (p[i] != 0) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < m; ++j) {\n                tt[i + j] = (tt[i + j] + p[i] * q[j]) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = m + m - 1; i >= m; --i) if (tt[i] != 0) {\n            for (int j = m - 1; j >= 0; --j) {\n                tt[i - j - 1] = (tt[i - j - 1] + tt[i] * h[j]) % MOD;\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) p[i] = tt[i];\n    }\n\n    static long check(long n) {\n        long ans = 0;\n        String st = Long.toString(n);\n        int len = st.length();\n        if (n > 0) ans++;\n        for (int i = 1; i < T; i++) {\n            long cur = 1;\n            long num = n;\n            for (int j = 0; j + 1 < i; j++) {\n                cur = cur * 10;\n            }\n            for (int j = len; j < i; j++) num *= 10;\n            if (i < len) {\n                String pref = \"\";\n                for (int j = 0; j < i; j++) pref += st.charAt(j);\n                num = Long.parseLong(pref);\n                num++;\n            }\n            if (num > up) num = up;\n            if (num > cur) ans += num - cur;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        n++;\n        up = n;\n        long part = n % MOD * (n / MOD1 + 2) % MOD;\n        part = MOD - part;\n        long ans = 0;\n        for (long i = -n / MOD1 - 1; i <= n / MOD1 + 1; i++) {\n            long cur = 0;\n            for (int j = 0; j < T; j++) {\n                long L = 0, R = 1;\n                if (j >= 1) {\n                    L = 1;\n                    for (int k = 0; k + 1 < j; k++) {\n                        L *= 10;\n                    }\n                    R = L * 10;\n                }\n                if (R > n) R = n;\n                long lastr = R;\n                if (L < R) {\n                    L--;\n                    while (R - L > 1) {\n                        long mid = (R + L) / 2;\n                        if (check(mid) > mid + MOD1 * i - 1) R = mid;\n                        else L = mid;\n                    }\n                    cur += lastr - R;\n                }\n            }\n            ans += cur;\n        }\n        ans %= MOD;\n        ans = (-(ans + part % MOD) % MOD) * MOD1;\n        ans %= MOD;\n        System.out.println((MOD + ans % MOD) % MOD);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-3.576278e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -5.0